  "body": "## What changed\n\nOne row of `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` (the \"Pass starts at (#3316)\" row). The row said that other kinds get the key in their own issues. Those issues are merged. The row now says:\n\n- The key `pass_start` is on 2D Pocket, 2D Adaptive, Circular, Bore, 3D Pocket and 3D Finish, and on 2D Offset (already in the row). It uses the same `edit_operation` door.\n- Absent means `\"auto\"`. The project file does not write `\"auto\"`. The reply leaves it out.\n- Where the choice is not used, the app says so. 2D Pocket with Zigzag rows or with rest machining carries a `Pass starts at` note. 3D Pocket carries it with the Zigzag or Auto strategy, with rest machining, or with the Adaptive (HSM) strategy. A 3D Finish reads the key only for Contour and Flat; the op page says that the other patterns have no ring order.\n- 2D Adaptive with the Trochoidal method refuses `\"inside\"` and `\"outside\"` by name, at the edit and again at `generate`.\n- Face, Slot and Trochoidal Slot refuse the key by name. Any other kind refuses it as an unknown field.\n\n## Source lines that prove each statement\n\n- Field on the kinds: `crates/app/src/operation/types/params.rs` (Pocket, Adaptive2D, Offset2D, Circular, Pocket3D, Finish3D, Bore).\n- Values `auto` / `inside` / `outside`, default Auto: `crates/app/src/project/pass_start_dto.rs:15-20`.\n- The reply leaves `auto` out: `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs:326-327` (the reply is the written params). Lines 111-113 of the same file serve only the internal unknown-field check.\n- Refusal by name for Face, Slot, Trochoidal Slot: `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs:65-75`.\n- Unknown field on other kinds: the round-trip check in `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs` (`pass_start_kept`).\n- Trochoidal refusal: `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_hsm_start.rs:70-77`. It is called at the edit by `named_refusal` (`crates/app/src/operation/types/sane.rs:87`, from `crates/app/src/commands/operation/edit.rs:114`) and at `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs:902`. Pinned by `trochoidal_adaptive_refuses_a_forced_pass_start_by_name` in `crates/app/tests/adaptive_pass_start.rs`.\n- Notes: `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pass_start.rs` (Zigzag, rest), `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs:329`, `crates/motion/src/machining3d/level_side.rs:19-20, 34-41` (3D Pocket cases), `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` (2D rest note).\n- 3D Finish reads only Contour and Flat: `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/shadow.rs:259-262`; op page text in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill3d_page.rs`.\n\n## Not done here\n\nThe issue also asks for a row in `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`. That file is generated and has no `pass_start` text. The generic `edit_operation` door has no per-kind rows there. A hand edit of a generated file is not possible, so this PR does not change it.\n\nNo build ran: the change is text in one skill file.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #3569\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
